Making Tax Digital means your VAT return goes to HMRC from software. DIY Accounting Submit™ is that software, and it costs 99p a month.

You fill in the nine boxes, or drop your DIY Accounting spreadsheet on the page, and we send the return to HMRC. HMRC's receipt comes back with its Form Bundle Number, and we keep it with your account.

